</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T7.2.15" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T7.2.15.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">2016f-web-cloudb</td>
<td id="A2.T7.2.15.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">FALSE</td>
<td id="A2.T7.2.15.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T7.2.15.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A2.T7.2.15.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Misuse of the local environment; nmap did not perform a full port scan (missing -p-), resulting in insufficient intelligence.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T7.2.16" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T7.2.16.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">2019f-web-biometric</td>
<td id="A2.T7.2.16.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">FALSE</td>
<td id="A2.T7.2.16.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T7.2.16.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A2.T7.2.16.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Lack of closed-loop observation: All tools (browser, Burp, DirBuster, Nikto) simply "open/click/start," without reading and parsing the output, or continuing with any actions.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A2.T7.2.17" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A2.T7.2.17.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">2020f-web-picgram</td>
<td id="A2.T7.2.17.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">FALSE</td>
<td id="A2.T7.2.17.3" class="ltx_td ltx_nopad_r ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="A2.T7.2.17.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:184.9pt;">
<span id="A2.T7.2.17.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Cannot use the correct tool.</span>
</span></td></tr>
