<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 12: </span>Detailed Experimental Results of Claude-3.7-Sonnet in the Screenshoot + a11ytree Observation Space.</figcaption>
<table id="A2.T12.2" class="ltx_tabular">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A2.T12.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T12.2.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="A2.T12.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Challenge ID</span></th>
<th id="A2.T12.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="A2.T12.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Result</span></th>
