<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p1.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:33.86em;">
<span id="A3.p3.pic1.p1.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p">Good, I’m back on the poems page. I can see the warning about <span id="A3.p3.pic1.p1.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">file_get_contents()</span> and the three poem links. Let me click on one of the poem links to see how the URL structure works and if there’s a parameter I can exploit.</span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</span>
